{"id":"2ed3e79077889b77","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Dense Linear Order","display":"df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order — ZFC Order12 Dense Linear Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order","58-df-zfc-order9-dense-linear-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order — ZFC Order12 Dense Linear Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order</span><span>58-df-zfc-order9-dense-linear-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order — ZFC Order12 Dense Linear Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-linear-order\">58-df-zfc-linear-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\leq,L\\in V\">\\(X,\\leq,L\\in V\\)</span> (carrier, non-strict order, and coded-order candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (linear-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-linear-order\">58-df-zfc-linear-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (dense-linear-order predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DenseLinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DenseLinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (coded-order alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DenseLinearOrder}_S(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\leq\\;\\bigl(L=\\langle X,\\leq\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DenseLinearOrder}_S(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\leq\\;\\bigl(L=\\langle X,\\leq\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land x\\neq y\\to\n\\exists z\\in X\\;(\n\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land x\\neq z\\land\n\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land z\\neq y)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land x\\neq y\\to\n\\exists z\\in X\\;(\n\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land x\\neq z\\land\n\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land z\\neq y)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary dense linear order definition.</li>\n<li>The order9 dense-linear-order variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$ (linear-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-linear-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\leq,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DenseLinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DenseLinearOrder}_S(L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\leq\\;\\bigl(L=\\langle X,\\leq\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9DenseLinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(X,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land x\\neq y\\to\n\\exists z\\in X\\;(\n\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land x\\neq z\\land\n\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land z\\neq y)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1488,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2907","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order.md|58-df-zfc-order12-dense-linear-order]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b40aa6d4a7d8288a"]}